assertion: NUM WITH
##
## Ends in an error in state: 45.
##
## reg_loc -> NUM . COLON IDENT [ LBRACKET EQ ]
##
## The known suffix of the stack is as follows:
## NUM
##

Expected ':' after the thread number '$0': register locations are written
TID:REG, e.g. $0:X0.
Hint: '&' and '|' bind looser than '=', so 0:X0 = 1 | $0 is parsed as
(0:X0 = 1) | $0, where $0 starts a new register location like $0:X0.
To use them as bitwise operators on a value, parenthesize it: 0:X0 = (1 | $0).

